      "situation": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Imagine reading an old report about someone making a major claim, rather than someone you have met."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You want to understand what the report conveys, then consider what can be inferred from it."
