      "eyebrow": null,
      "title": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What does another report add?"
        }
      ],
      "style": "standard",
      "visual": null,
      "evidence": null,
      "points": [
        {
          "point_id": "pt_1",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_017",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In another Bukhari report, Abu Sufyan's answer denies accusations of lying before Muhammad's claim."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": [
              "src_c_u0_l11_08"
            ]
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_2",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_018",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The report includes an answer about keeping promises, with Abu Sufyan reserving judgement about a current truce."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": [
              "src_c_u0_l11_09"
            ]
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_3",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_019",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "According to it, he described a call to worship God alone, pray, speak truthfully, be chaste and maintain family ties."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": [
              "src_c_u0_l11_10"
            ]
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_4",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_020",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Keep an account of conduct, an account of his message, and a judgement about prophethood separate."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
