      "evidence": null,
      "points": [
        {
          "point_id": "pt_1",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_028",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reading a report identifies what the source conveys; accepting that the event occurred requires examining the report."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_2",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_029",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A report about the listeners' trust concerns credibility in their experience, and does not alone establish the message's source."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_3",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_030",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Evaluating the messenger claim brings together transmission, conduct and message, respecting the limits of each piece of evidence."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_4",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_031",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Write down what the report conveys, what it supports, and what still needs examination."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b_u0_l11_10",
      "type": "exercise",
      "exercise": {
        "exercise_id": "ex_u0_l11_03",
        "type": "spot_error",
        "concept_ids": [
          "con_u0_muhammad_claim"
        ],
        "prompt": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Where does the conclusion stop matching the evidence?"
          }
        ],
        "time_limit_ms": null,
        "scoring": {
          "accuracy": true,
          "combo": true,
          "layer": "apply"
        },
        "framing": null,
        "payload": {
          "segments": [
            {
              "segment_id": "seg_1",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The Safa report conveys an answer about his honesty."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment_id": "seg_2",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "That bears on a question about earlier conduct."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment_id": "seg_3",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Therefore that answer alone establishes everything included in the messenger claim."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b_u0_l11_11",
      "type": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "spans": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You do not need to adopt someone else's judgement to understand what the sources report."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Direct questions to the report, meaning and evidence while respecting the people concerned."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b_u0_l11_12",
      "type": "exercise",
      "exercise": {
        "exercise_id": "ex_u0_l11_04",
        "type": "scenario",
        "concept_ids": [
          "con_u0_muhammad_claim"
        ],
        "prompt": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "How should this reader continue the examination?"
          }
        ],
        "time_limit_ms": null,
        "scoring": {
          "accuracy": true,
          "combo": true,
          "layer": "apply"
        },
        "framing": null,
        "payload": {
          "situation": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Imagine a reader understanding the Safa report but not knowing how it reached the collection."
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_a",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Ask about transmission, reference and explanation, then compare its significance with the question being examined."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_b",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Force acceptance because the story has been understood."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_c",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Conclude that not knowing the details proves the event never occurred."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b_u0_l11_13",
      "type": "teach",
      "eyebrow": null,
      "title": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "From a report to the appropriate question"
        }
      ],
      "style": "summary",
      "visual": null,
      "evidence": null,
      "points": [
        {
          "point_id": "pt_1",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_037",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "According to the report, they answered that their experience with him had been truthful."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": [
              "src_c_u0_l11_03"
            ]
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_2",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_038",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "According to it, he described a call to worship God alone, pray, speak truthfully, be chaste and maintain family ties."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": [
              "src_c_u0_l11_10"
            ]
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_3",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_039",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A no-reward statement identifies what a claimant says, while examining conduct requires its supporting reports."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "pt_4",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l11_040",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Evaluating the messenger claim brings together transmission, conduct and message, respecting the limits of each piece of evidence."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
